'''True Assassin's Gauntlet''' (真アサシン強襲！, ''Ma Asashin Kyōshū！'', '''True Assassin Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, rewards and progress made in True Assassin's Gauntlet will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet is [[True Assassin (Enemy)|True Assassin]].

==Overview==
True Assassin's Gauntlet contains a total of 10 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards and gauntlet progress reset with every appearance of the event.

